<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Syunmu"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="May'n"/><amll:meta key="album" value="15Colors -Nu Skool- - EP"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPZ922011126"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1534998916"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Maigo Hanyuu</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">当傲然盛放的花朵飘零之时</text><text for="L2">你在放声歌唱</text><text for="L3">樱色斑驳 思念的尽头</text><text for="L4">呼吸渐渐变得凌乱</text><text for="L5">仿佛快要溺毙</text><text for="L6">曾是那样的寂寞</text><text for="L7">仿佛快要满溢</text><text for="L8">曾是那样惹人怜爱</text><text for="L9">跨越时光化为形体</text><text for="L10">我缓缓下沉</text><text for="L11">成千上万次</text><text for="L12">你的发丝都在轻轻摇曳</text><text for="L13">成千上万次</text><text for="L14">你都不肯等一等我啊</text><text for="L15">自海平线之上道一句明天见</text><text for="L16">嗯 这是我们的约定</text><text for="L17">仿佛快要失去</text><text for="L18">曾是那样的悲伤</text><text for="L19">仿佛触手可及</text><text for="L20">手却早已放开</text><text for="L21">那些漂流至海底的宝物</text><text for="L22">成千上万次</text><text for="L23">都能听见你的声音</text><text for="L24">成千上万次</text><text for="L25">好想化作你的双眸</text><text for="L26">若今晚便是最后那就明天见吧</text><text for="L27">嗯 我会无数次重现今天</text><text for="L28">成千上万次</text><text for="L29">多想触碰你的指尖</text><text for="L30">成千上万次</text><text for="L31">多想倚靠在你的肩头</text><text for="L32">平行线的此刻也将迎来黎明</text><text for="L33">嗯 无论多少次</text><text for="L34">流转吧流转吧 春日之梦</text><text for="L35">请别醒来 不要留我孤身一人</text><text for="L36">春风掠过的孤独尽头</text><text for="L37">多么乏味 多么可怕</text><text for="L38">曾经那样灿烂地盛放</text><text for="L39">都能听见你的歌声</text><text for="L40">曾经那样灿烂地盛放</text><text for="L41">属于你的春天即将启程</text><text for="L42">再见 再见</text><text for="L43">今晚也多谢你啦</text><text for="L44">这大概已是最后了吧</text><text for="L45">曾那样快乐</text><text for="L46">曾那样欣喜</text><text for="L47">仿佛能展露笑容</text><text for="L48">才猛然发觉自己仿佛已能向前迈步 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(明天见)</span></text><text for="L49">再见啦 再见啦</text><text for="L50">我仍在静候春来</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:20.045"><div begin="0:08.573" end="3:20.045"><p begin="0:08.573" end="0:14.193" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.573" end="0:09.183">誉</span><span begin="0:09.183" end="0:09.413">れ</span><span begin="0:09.413" end="0:10.243">誉</span><span begin="0:10.243" end="0:10.813">れ</span><span begin="0:10.813" end="0:11.013">と</span><span begin="0:11.013" end="0:11.343">咲</span><span begin="0:11.343" end="0:11.653">く</span><span begin="0:11.653" end="0:12.193">花</span><span begin="0:12.493" end="0:13.123">散</span><span begin="0:13.123" end="0:13.313">る</span><span begin="0:13.313" end="0:13.963">頃</span><span begin="0:13.963" end="0:14.193">に</span></p><p begin="0:14.583" end="0:16.763" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.583" end="0:15.383">貴方</span><span begin="0:15.383" end="0:15.703">が</span><span begin="0:15.703" end="0:16.283">歌</span><span begin="0:16.283" end="0:16.763">う</span></p><p begin="0:17.555" end="0:21.835" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.555" end="0:18.525">桜</span><span begin="0:18.525" end="0:19.385">色、</span><span begin="0:19.385" end="0:20.245">想</span><span begin="0:20.245" end="0:20.465">い</span><span begin="0:20.465" end="0:20.715">の</span><span begin="0:20.715" end="0:20.975">果</span><span begin="0:20.975" end="0:21.525">て</span><span begin="0:21.525" end="0:21.835">に</span></p><p begin="0:22.201" end="0:26.011" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.201" end="0:22.731">息</span><spa